    "uawake": {
      "comment": "Main window title"
    },
    "uawake keeps your Mac awake when you need it: downloads, presentations, calls and long tasks. It stops by itself at low battery, in Low Power Mode or when your Mac gets too warm.": {},
    "uawake needs Bluetooth access to see which of your devices are connected.": {
      "comment": "Permission explanation"
    },
    "uawake needs Calendar access to know when an event is in progress. Events never leave your Mac.": {
      "comment": "Permission explanation"
    },
